      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/FCT_DRTS/status/1974928392920195269",
      "text": "Traffic Advisory\nDay 10, 6th October, 2025\nConstruction of Mohammed Isa Road Extension in Asokoro Abuja.\n\nMotorists plying Asokoro, especially those using Hassan Kastina Road, Mohamed Isma Street, Mahatir Mohammed Street and other nearby locations, that traffic will be slightly affected during movement of dignitaries to Aminu Ifesinachi Crescent, Asokoro District, Abuja - venue of the event.\n\nThe intersection of Deng Xiaopong Street and Mahatir Mohammed Street will be covered by traffic and security personnel to ensure seamless flow.\nYour patience and cooperation is highly solicited.\n\n- Head Traffic, DRTS",
